{"id":"assassino","lemma":"assassino","pos":"adj","rank":475,"glosses":["murderous"],"ipa":"/a.saˈsĩ.nu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-assassino.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-assassino.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"assassina","masculinePlural":"assassinos","femininePlural":"assassinas"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu sei quem é o assassino.","en":"I know who the killer is.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"O assassino levou a arma consigo.","en":"The murderer took the weapon with him.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"levar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"weapon"},{"g":"to get, obtain","l":"conseguir"}]},{"text":"O assassino nunca foi pego.","en":"The killer was never caught.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1271165","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to grab, hold","l":"pegar"}]},{"text":"Você não parece um assassino.","en":"You don't look like a killer.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom sabia quem era o assassino.","en":"Tom knew who the killer was.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}